# `rw serve` writes runtime state here for as long as a server is up. Prettier
# 3 reads .gitignore, but only the one beside its working directory — the entry
# covering this path is the .gitignore rw writes *inside* the .rw directory,
# which Prettier never sees. Without this, `make format` after a local e2e run
# rewrites the JSON of a live server. Matched anywhere: the data dir name is
# not configurable.
**/.rw/
